---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hyphos"
  description="Hyphos helps growing businesses handle more revenue with the people they already have by connecting company information with the knowledge and judgment of the people who keep the work moving."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-ink-200/60">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-5">Connected operations · usable knowledge</div>
        <h1 class="display text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.02] text-ink-900">
          Handle more revenue with the people you already have.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
          Hyphos connects the systems your business runs on with the knowledge and
          judgment of the people who keep them moving—so more work gets done without
          adding the same coordination overhead.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-500">
          <span>Connected information</span>
          <span class="text-ink-300">·</span>
          <span>Captured expertise</span>
          <span class="text-ink-300">·</span>
          <span>Automated coordination</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
            Find the constraint
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/work#cornerstone" class="btn-secondary">See the proof</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.35fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">The growth constraint</div>
        <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight text-ink-900">
          Growth eventually runs into the people holding everything together.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
        <p>
          Most successful companies reach a point where their systems are disconnected
          and a few key people have to carry the context between them. They know which
          spreadsheet is right, which exception matters, who needs to be called, and what
          the process really means when the written procedure stops being useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          Revenue keeps growing, but so does the coordination load. The organization adds
          people to move information, chase decisions, and protect against things slipping
          through the cracks.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-ink-900">
          That is not simply a staffing problem. It is an information-and-judgment problem.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <article class="card p-6">
        <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">01 · Disconnected</div>
        <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">The information is scattered.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Customer history, schedules, finance, documents, and conversations live in
          different systems that do not share context.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card p-6">
        <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">02 · Concentrated</div>
        <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">The judgment lives in a few heads.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          Experienced people become the routing layer because only they know how the
          pieces relate and when the normal rule does not apply.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card p-6">
        <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">03 · Constrained</div>
        <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">Capacity stops scaling.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
          More revenue creates more handoffs, more checking, and more dependence on the
          same people instead of more leverage from what the company already knows.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ink-950 text-cream-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="eyebrow text-signal-300 mb-4">What Hyphos changes</div>
        <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight">
          Connect the systems. Capture the judgment. Put both to work.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <article class="border-t border-cream-50/20 pt-6">
          <div class="display text-3xl text-signal-300">01</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl mt-4">See the actual work</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-100/70">
            We sit with the people doing the work and map the systems, handoffs,
            exceptions, and decisions that determine whether revenue moves or stalls.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border-t border-cream-50/20 pt-6">
          <div class="display text-3xl text-signal-300">02</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl mt-4">Build the connected layer</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-100/70">
            We connect the tools that should stay, replace the patchwork that cannot,
            and create one dependable flow of information through the business.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border-t border-cream-50/20 pt-6">
          <div class="display text-3xl text-signal-300">03</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl mt-4">Make expertise reusable</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-100/70">
            The system uses the company’s real record together with experienced judgment,
            so routine work moves without routing every decision through the same people.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-3 rounded-xl border border-cream-50/15 bg-cream-50/5">
        <div class="p-6 sm:border-r border-cream-50/15">
          <div class="display text-2xl">More capacity</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cream-100/60">Revenue grows faster than coordination overhead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 border-t sm:border-t-0 sm:border-r border-cream-50/15">
          <div class="display text-2xl">Less dependence</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cream-100/60">The business stops relying on memory and heroics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 border-t sm:border-t-0 border-cream-50/15">
          <div class="display text-2xl">Better work</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cream-100/60">People keep the relationships and judgment calls.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="eyebrow text-warm-600">In production</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-ink-500">Cornerstone Funeral Home</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight text-ink-900">
          One business. One connected operating system.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-700">
          Cornerstone had a public website, paper processes, family communications,
          scheduling, marketing, finance, and reporting that required people to carry
          information between them. Hyphos replaced that coordination layer with sixteen
          connected modules on one database.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          The result is not “more software.” It is a business that can handle more activity
          without rebuilding the same context by hand every day.
        </p>
        <a href="/work#cornerstone" class="link inline-block mt-7">Read the Cornerstone case study →</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="card overflow-hidden p-0">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2">
          <div class="p-6 border-r border-b border-ink-200">
            <div class="display text-2xl text-ink-900">16 modules</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-600">One database underneath the operation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border-b border-ink-200">
            <div class="display text-2xl text-ink-900">~$98k / yr</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-600">Marketing and operations spend reclaimed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border-r border-ink-200">
            <div class="display text-2xl text-ink-900">4–5 hrs / wk</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-600">For one staff member to run the marketing stack.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="display text-2xl text-ink-900">One record</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-600">Customer, operational, and financial context stays connected.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-ink-200/60 bg-cream-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">How we deploy it</div>
        <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink-900">One outcome, three starting points.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink-600 leading-relaxed">
          The right starting point depends on what already works, what cannot be replaced,
          and where the organization is most dependent on manual coordination.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <a href="/services#build" class="card p-6 group">
          <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">Connect</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">Integrate what you have.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
            Connect the systems that must stay and automate the work currently happening between them.
          </p>
          <span class="link inline-block mt-5 text-sm">Integration work →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/products#foundation" class="card p-6 group">
          <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">Operate</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">Replace the patchwork.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
            Deploy the connected operating platform when the existing stack cannot be made coherent.
          </p>
          <span class="link inline-block mt-5 text-sm">Foundation →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://hyphos.io" class="card p-6 group">
          <div class="eyebrow text-signal-600 mb-3">Know</div>
          <h3 class="display text-xl text-ink-900">Make expertise available.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
            Connect meetings, documents, decisions, and experienced judgment into usable organizational knowledge.
          </p>
          <span class="link inline-block mt-5 text-sm">Knowledge platform →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24 text-center">
    <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Start with the constraint</div>
    <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight text-ink-900">
      Where does growth still depend on someone holding the whole picture in their head?
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      We will look at the actual work, identify where information and judgment are constraining capacity,
      and tell you plainly what is worth changing.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8">Start a conversation</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
